{"baseRefName":"stack/5-declared-ports","baseRefOid":"c821b86b3cc855af15a5f5dedf9b9fe14b985912","body":"> Replaces #397\n> \n> 6 of 6.\n> \n> ### Prerequisites, as the first three commits\n> - Duplicate and paste rewrite ids only, not every UUID-shaped string.\n> - A note keeps its id across a save.\n> - SuperShape's N31 keeps its negative default across a save.\n> \n> ### Clone sets\n> - A set holds one stored graph, and its members are instances of it.\n> - When an edit's undo group closes, the edited member becomes the stored graph and each sibling is patched to it, inside the same group. Undo and redo put siblings back with the edit.\n> - A changed node takes the stored settings through `Graph.setSettings`, in place. Nodes are never remade, so untouched nodes keep their objects and runtime state.\n> - Published inlet values stay each member's own.\n> - Node menu: Duplicate as Clone, Rename Clone Set, Select Sibling Clones, Unlink from Clones. The breadcrumb shows a linked glyph.\n> \n> ### Tests\n> `CloneSetContractTests` and `CloneSetTests`, 120 tests, with no known issues.","files":[{"path":"AGENTS.md","additions":1,"deletions":0,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"Fabric Editor/Views/BreadcrumbEntry.swift","additions":39,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"Fabric Editor/Views/ContentView.swift","additions":5,"deletions":3,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"Fabric/Graph/CloneSet.swift","additions":112,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"Fabric/Graph/CloneSetCoordinator.swift","additions":132,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"Fabric/Graph/FabricError.swift","additions":3,"deletions":0,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"Fabric/Graph/Graph+ClonePatch.swift","additions":635,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"Fabric/Graph/Graph+CloneSet.swift","additions":642,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"Fabric/Graph/Graph.swift","additions":206,"deletions":49,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"Fabric/Graph/GraphCanvasContext.swift","additions":20,"deletions":7,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"Fabric/Graph/Node/NodeSettings.swift","additions":13,"deletions":0,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"Fabric/Graph/Node/NodeStatus.swift","additions":8,"deletions":2,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"Fabric/Graph/Note.swift","additions":6,"deletions":2,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"Fabric/Nodes/Geometry/SuperShape/SuperShapeGeometryNode.swift","additions":1,"deletions":1,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"Fabric/Nodes/Object/SubGraph/SubgraphNode.swift","additions":207,"deletions":5,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"Fabric/Utils/AnyEncodable.swift","additions":10,"deletions":0,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"Fabric/Views/Graph/CloneSetContextMenu.swift","additions":144,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"Fabric/Views/Graph/GraphNodesView.swift","additions":11,"deletions":0,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"Fabric/Views/Nodes/NodeStatusGlyph.swift","additions":40,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"Fabric/Views/Nodes/NodeTitleView.swift","additions":3,"deletions":24,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"Fabric/Views/Parameters/ParameterGroupView.swift","additions":18,"deletions":3,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"GLOSSARY.md","additions":3,"deletions":0,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"Tests/CloneSetContractTests.swift","additions":2701,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"Tests/CloneSetModel.swift","additions":32,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"Tests/CloneSetTests.swift","additions":934,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"Tests/GraphDuplicationTests.swift","additions":36,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"Tests/NoteCodingTests.swift","additions":33,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"}],"headRefName":"stack/6-clone-sets","headRefOid":"6841b08270e213f7c2686e83329bc1da844cf5d8","title":"Clone Sets – Sub graphs can be cloned within a document","url":"https://github.com/Fabric-Project/Fabric/pull/411"}
